8256D71A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1221117006:1":{"text":"お母さん、最近ずっとため息ばかりついてるでしょ？だから海に手紙を書いて、ニジイロダイをくださいってお願いしたんだ。お母さんにプロポーズした時に贈ったって、お父さんが言ってた！","source_cn":"妈妈最近总是叹气，所以我偷偷写了一封许愿信，希望大海能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCF1C36D4D59D7AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1221117007:1":{"text":"ボク、お母さんに喜んでほしいんだ。お父さんとお兄ちゃんもきっとそう思ってるよ！","source_cn":"妈妈，安尔姆希望你能开心一点，爸爸和哥哥肯定也是这么想的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE3EBBD26B9D2D16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1221117008:1":{"text":"大丈夫だよ、二人はすごい航海士なんだから、きっと無事に帰って来るよ！","source_cn":"别担心了，他们可是最厉害的引航员，一定会平安回来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF2E6A1A8FDF08E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1221117009:1":{"text":"アルム……ええ、そうね。分かったわ、お母さんもう落ち込んだりしない……ありがとう、大好きよ、アルム。","source_cn":"好……乖孩子，不愧是我的小安尔姆。妈妈知道了，妈妈……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x410243720DC3C607","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1221117010:1":{"text":"ふふ、ニジイロダイを飼うのはこれで二回目だわ。大事に育てましょうね。","source_cn":"我们去把幻彩鲷养起来吧？这还是妈妈第二次养这种鱼呢。","status"